      <LongDescription>The &lt;noparse&gt;SGT-367 Aerial Torpedo&lt;/noparse&gt; is a size 3 direct guidance missile.  It is based on the SGT-3 body, which is a heavy anti-ship torpedo.  This missile will deliver a Contact Fuze, High Explosive, Shaped warhead.  It homes in on its target using command guidance from its launching ship.  If the primary seeker does not find a target or is jammed, it can fall back on a Radar Anti-Radiation seeker.

